<title>USA: Dura says bond underwriters exercise option.</title>
<headline>Dura says bond underwriters exercise option.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dura Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday that underwriters of its recent sale of convertible subordinated notes have exercised their over-allotment option and purchased an additional $37.5 million worth of notes.</p>
<p>The principal amount of the sale now totals $287.5 million. Merrill Lynch &amp; Co and Goldman, Sachs acted as underwriters for the offering.</p>
